==Battleground==
*1 [[Red Slug]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Black Slug]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is relatively simple. Red Sluggy and Black Sluggy are quite weak and can be defeated easily using [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] while Angel Sluggy and THE SLOTH are easy to stall with meatshields. A well timed [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can easily defeat both enemies giving you an easy victory.

